## About the Project

**Grama Khata** is an Android application that digitizes the traditional credit management system used by small village shopkeepers in rural Karnataka. It replaces physical *"Vahi"* (credit books) with a simple, offline-first digital ledger — with AI-powered daily reports and WhatsApp payment reminders.

---

