## Setup Instructions

### Prerequisites
- Android Studio (Panda 2025.3.1 or later)
- Android device or emulator (API 24+, Android 7.0 minimum)
- Google Gemini API key — free from [aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey)

### Step 1 — Clone the repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/DHANUSHREEPGOWDA/Grama-Khata.git
```

### Step 2 — Open in Android Studio
1. File → Open → Select the `Grama-Khata` folder
2. Wait for Gradle sync to complete

### Step 3 — Add your Gemini API key
Open this file:
```
app/src/main/java/com/gramakhata/data/repository/AiRepository.kt
```
Replace the placeholder:
```kotlin
private val API_KEY = "YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE"
```
With your actual key:
```kotlin
private val API_KEY = "AIza..."
```
Get your free key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey

### Step 4 — Run the app
- Connect your Android phone (USB Debugging ON) or use an emulator
- Click **Run ▶** in Android Studio
- Minimum SDK: Android 7.0 (API 24)

---

## How AI Works (Gemini)

### WhatsApp Reminder
When you tap **WhatsApp** on a customer with pending due:
1. App sends customer name + due amount to Gemini API
2. Gemini generates a polite reminder message in English
3. App opens WhatsApp with the message pre-filled and ready to send

### Daily Collection Report
1. Go to Dashboard tab
2. Enter your shop name
3. Tap **Generate AI Daily Report**
4. Gemini analyzes all pending dues and generates a full summary

---

## Database Schema

### customers table
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER (PK) | Auto-generated ID |
| name | TEXT | Customer name |
| phone | TEXT | Phone number |
| photoUri | TEXT | Optional profile photo |
| createdAt | LONG | Creation timestamp |

### transactions table
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER (PK) | Auto-generated ID |
| customerId | INTEGER (FK) | References customers.id |
| amount | DOUBLE | Transaction amount |
| type | ENUM | CREDIT (paid) or DEBIT (due) |
| note | TEXT | Optional note |
| timestamp | LONG | Transaction timestamp |

